				"basis": "authored",
				"id": "file-upload.name",
				"text": "The browse button is named \"<label>: Browse file\" (\"Browse files\" with multiple, \"Replace file\" once a single file is chosen). The native file input is hidden from assistive technology."
			},
			{
				"basis": "authored",
				"id": "file-upload.status",
				"text": "The selection summary is a polite status region, so each new choice is announced. Every listed file has its own remove button named \"Remove <file name>\"."
			}
		]
